{"id":"vod_md_2192","vodId":"2192","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"荒川爆笑团‎","name_cn":"荒川爆笑团‎","date":"2010-01-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"13集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230809-1/34f1d7553893d3b90f8d7a6c728584a0.jpg"},"summary":"大财团公子哥市之宫行（神谷浩史 配音）自由不知愁滋味，俨然叼着金汤匙出生的金贵少爷，就读于名门学府T大的他即将毕业，未来的人生一片光明，令人欣羡。他铭记市之宫家的家训“不求人，不欠人”，并以此为傲。可是现实的残酷却不得不令他拖欠人情，在开车通过荒川河时，他被几名少年抢走名贵跑车，裤子也被强行扒下挂在桥顶。强逞英雄的阿行爬桥不慎跌落水中，危急时刻被附近的少女小珊（坂本真绫 配音）救助。拖欠了人情的阿行答应作小珊的恋人，他极不情愿地随着这个自称金星人的少女留在荒川河床，并解释了在此生活的一对电波系怪人：河童村长、星星、武士、修女、铁人兄弟等。有趣怪诞的故事就此展开……本片根据中村光的同名漫画改编。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-09 08:20:25","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230808/XVHOFYS0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230808/TBnJTtoy/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230808/Fhmgki8h/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230808/7KTjcc5t/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230808/BV8ZfhJB/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230808/cfeIUzgw/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230808/WLvwKhDa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230808/g5dRegb1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230808/KHVdIGXI/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230808/1VbYNDMY/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230808/GjjX6IsP/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230808/S8gEbUGU/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230808/PZq5D1rD/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:36:16.017Z"}